[l_english.STATE_LORE_190]
Appleloosa, this dusty, wild town, once the pride of the Apple family, is now their last bastion for a comeback. After their glory in Ponyville was crushed by Trixie’s honeyed words and Canterlot’s iron hooves, the Apple family was forced to retreat to this windswept frontier, brimming with resentment and cartloads of cider.
Leading the charge is “Cousin” Braeburn. His smile once warmed like apple pie. But after misfortunes befell several family members, his gaze can now be as chilling as an autumn frost. No pony knows where he gets all the gold to pay the bounty hunters in the taverns, but every pony fears that if you cross Braeburn or his Apple family, next season’s apple trees might just be fertilized with your bones. Calling the police won't do any good; not only does Sheriff Silverstar have a long-standing “business relationship” with Braeburn, but Braeburn’s newly acquired status as an Empire-sanctioned autonomous district chief is enough for him to dominate part of Southern Equestria.
After the Empire’s victory, Appleloosa was outwardly incorporated into their territory. In reality, Braeburn had long bought off Sheriff Silverstar with cases of cider, bags of shining gold, and a loaded shotgun as “gifts of friendship”. While the Empire was preoccupied with northern conflicts, the sheriff turned a blind eye to the Apple family’s dealings (perhaps profiting handsomely himself), and one case after another dominoed into the establishment of the autonomous district.
Braeburn hosts annual "family meetings", always beginning with apple pie and whiskey, and ending with whispered oaths and hoof-shaking promises. Creatures arriving, whether from the Rock Farm, Ponyville, the Buffalo Tribe, or Las Pegasus, would line up in an office to kiss “Cousin” Braeburn’s forehoof. However, if you're a member or friend of the Apple family, you’ll find Braeburn to be a kind and friendly pony who loves buckball, just as he always was.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_190]
苹果鲁萨，这片尘土飞扬的荒野小镇，曾是苹果家族的骄傲，如今却是他们卷土重来的最后堡垒。小马谷的荣光被特丽克西的甜言蜜语与坎特洛特的铁蹄碾碎后，苹果家族被迫退守这片黄沙漫天的边陲，带着满腔不甘与一车车的苹果酒。
领头的是“表哥”布雷本，曾经他的笑容温暖如苹果派。在家族中的多名成员遭遇不幸后，如今他的眼神可以冷得像秋霜 —— 没有小马知道他从哪儿弄来那么多金币去支付酒馆中的一位位赏金猎手，但所有小马都担心，如果惹毛了布雷本或是他的苹果家族，下一季的苹果树可能就得用你的骨头当肥料。报警也不会什么作用，且不说银星警长已经与布雷本是长期合作关系，如今布雷本具有帝国认可的自治区区长身份，足以在南小马利亚的一隅一蹄遮天。
帝国胜利后，苹果鲁萨表面上被纳入版图，但实际上，布雷本早用一箱箱苹果酒、几袋金光闪闪和一把上了膛的火铳枪作为“友谊礼”收买了银星警长。趁着帝国忙于北方战乱，这位警长对苹果家族的生意睁一只眼闭一只眼（或许也从其中收获了不少），最终一件一件案子如多米诺骨牌一般促成了自治区的建立。
布雷本每年都会召开“家族会议”，这些会议总是以苹果派和威士忌开场，以低语的誓言和握蹄的承诺收尾。前来的生物们，无论是来自采石农场、小马谷、野牛部落还是洛马基，都会在一间办公室里排着队亲吻“表哥”的前蹄。但如果你是苹果家族的一员或是苹果家族的朋友，那么在生活中遇到布雷本，会发现他还和当年一样，是一只和善友好，喜欢蹬球的小马。
